---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
    <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
        <a href="/" class="text-blue-400 hover:text-blue-300 text-sm font-semibold mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Privacy Policy: QR on Phone</h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-8 font-mono">Last updated: July 2026</p>
        
        <section class="space-y-6 text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            <p>GS-APPS built the QR on Phone app as a Free app. This SERVICE is provided by GS-APPS at no cost and is intended for use as is.</p>
            <p>This page is used to inform visitors regarding our policies with the collection, use, and disclosure of Personal Information if anyone decided to use our Service.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Information Collection and Use</h2>
            <p>QR on Phone respects your privacy. We do not collect, store, transmit, or share any personally identifiable information. The app operates entirely locally on your device.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Camera Permission</h2>
            <p>In order to function as a barcode and QR code scanner, the app requires access to your device's camera. This access is strictly used in real-time to scan codes. The app does not take hidden photos, record videos, or transmit any camera feed data over the internet.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>The app does not utilize any third-party databases, tracking software, or cloud services (such as Firebase) to collect user data. All scanned information remains strictly on your device until you choose to share it or act upon it.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Security</h2>
            <p>We value your trust. Because our app does not collect or store any personal data, there is no risk of your personal information being leaked or compromised through our servers.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Thus, you are advised to review this page periodically for any changes. We will notify you of any changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page.</p>
            
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions or suggestions about our Privacy Policy, do not hesitate to contact us at: <a href="mailto:schumigeos@gmail.com" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">schumigeos@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </section>
    </main>
</Layout>